        "quote": "Each grease generator shall submit a quarterly grease report on the electronic form available on the City of Topeka utilities web page. The quarterly grease report shall be submitted on or before the last calendar day of March, June, September, and December in each year.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.830:block:0#text",
