          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 811,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.830:block:1",
          "start": 272
        },
        "quote": "Each quarterly grease report shall provide the following information, including, but not limited to, a record of the dates the grease trap and/or grease interceptor was cleaned, the name and contact information for the grease hauler, if applicable, and grease generator contact information. Failure to submit a quarterly grease report or failure to submit a complete report within 30 days of the due date may result in the issuance of a notice of violation and enforcement under Article II of Chapter 13.15 TMC. (Ord. 20157 § 11, 12-4-18.)",
